{"html":"<div class=\"led-customization\"><section class=\"led-hero\"><div class=\"container-site\"><nav class=\"led-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/zh/#capabilities\">定制能力</a><span>/</span><span>LED 产品定制</span></nav><div class=\"led-hero-grid\"><div><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">PRODUCT CUSTOMIZATION CAPABILITY</p><h1>LED 发光杯<br>与酒具定制</h1><p class=\"led-intro\">浏览 LED 发光杯、LED 冰桶与发光酒具配件，按型号核对 Logo、灯效和供电配置，并了解从需求、成型、组装到检查与包装的定制生产流程。</p><div class=\"led-ctas\"><a href=\"/zh/contact/?topic=custom-led-drinkware\" data-led-quote class=\"led-button\">沟通 LED 定制项目 ↗</a><a href=\"#led-products\" class=\"led-button led-button-outline\">浏览对应产品 ↓</a></div><p class=\"led-small\">产品规格、起订量与交付条件按具体项目确认。</p></div><div class=\"led-hero-visual\"><img src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware LED Light Up Color Changing Glow Cups\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"led-hero-caption\"><span>FGB-034</span><span>场景示意 · 产品参考</span></div></div></div></div></section>\n\n <section id=\"led-production\" class=\"led-section led-journey\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">FROM PRODUCT BRIEF TO SAMPLE APPROVAL</p><h2>从定制构想到亮灯成品。</h2><p>逐步了解产品、灯组与品牌装饰如何组合为你的 LED 项目。</p></div><div class=\"led-journey-grid\"><div><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"LED 定制生产流程\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"led-journey-tabs\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-led-step=\"0\"><span>01</span><strong>需求与选型</strong><small>确认产品需求书与样品审核项目。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"1\"><span>02</span><strong>壳体与 Logo 定制</strong><small>确认实物装饰样品。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"2\"><span>03</span><strong>灯组安装与整机组装</strong><small>检查装配、开关与部件固定。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"3\"><span>04</span><strong>亮灯检查与包装</strong><small>确认检查标准、包装与运输范围。</small></button></div><a class=\"led-text-link\" data-led-quote href=\"/zh/contact/\">沟通你的定制工艺 →</a></div><div class=\"led-journey-panels\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-0\" data-led-panel=\"0\" ><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-1-optimized.webp\" alt=\"需求与选型\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"><figcaption>场景示意 · 非工厂实拍 <b>01 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>需求与选型</h3><p>先选杯具、冰桶或配件，明确使用场景、尺寸、Logo、数量、目的地和到货要求。新外形另行评估模具开发。</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev disabled>← 上一步</button><span>确认产品需求书与样品审核项目。</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-1\" data-led-panel=\"1\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-2-optimized.webp\" alt=\"壳体与 Logo 定制\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>场景示意 · 非工厂实拍 <b>02 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>壳体与 Logo 定制</h3><p>准备所选壳体，核对材质、尺寸、图稿位置与装饰工艺，通过实物样品确认后再安排生产。</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← 上一步</button><span>确认实物装饰样品。</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-2\" data-led-panel=\"2\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-3-optimized.webp\" alt=\"灯组安装与整机组装\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>场景示意 · 非工厂实拍 <b>03 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>灯组安装与整机组装</h3><p>确认灯色、模式、触发与供电配置，安装适配灯组，检查开关、仓盖与部件固定。</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← 上一步</button><span>检查装配、开关与部件固定。</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-3\" data-led-panel=\"3\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"亮灯检查与包装\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>场景示意 · 非工厂实拍 <b>04 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>亮灯检查与包装</h3><p>对照确认样检查灯效、外观与 Logo，核对清洁说明、保护包装及订单适用的电池运输要求。</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← 上一步</button><span>确认检查标准、包装与运输范围。</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next disabled>下一步 →</button></div></div></div></div></div></section> <section class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">CUSTOMIZATION SCOPE</p><h2>明确每一项定制内容。</h2><p>先选产品，再核对配置与样品，确认后安排生产。</p></div><div class=\"led-spec-layout\"><table aria-label=\"LED 定制规格\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">产品与结构</th><td>选定杯具、冰桶或酒具配件，核对材质、尺寸与装配。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">灯效与触发</th><td>灯色、模式与触发方式按所选灯组确认。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">供电配置</th><td>电池开启方式或充电配置按型号与样品确认。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Logo 与图稿</th><td>核对工艺、印区及亮灯／熄灯时的图稿效果。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">清洁与测试</th><td>按实际型号确认清洁说明与所需测试。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">起订量与交期</th><td>按所选型号、配置、数量与包装单独报价。</td></tr></tbody></table><aside><h3>适用项目</h3><p>品牌活动<br>酒吧与饮品推广<br>发光礼品定制项目</p><h3>样品确认重点</h3><p>所选型号的灯效、电源仓、装饰与清洁要求。</p></aside></div></div></section>\n <section id=\"led-products\" class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">PRODUCT MODELS / BOOM Drinkware</p><h2>为你的品牌，选择合适的 LED 产品。</h2><p>浏览现有型号库。参考产品用于定义项目，最终规格与供货条件在报价中确认。</p></div><div class=\"led-filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"筛选 LED 产品\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部型号 <span>23</span></bu